---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
import DiscordIcon from '../components/DiscordIcon.astro';
---

<Site title="Join the playtest" description="Request to join the Firnreach playtest.">
	<div class="wrap">
		<header class="page-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Playtest</p>
			<h1>Request to join the playtest</h1>
		</header>
		<div class="prose playtest">
			<p>
				Firnreach is in active development. Until it's on Steam, playtest builds are shared with a small group through
				Google Drive, and every request is reviewed by hand.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a class="btn primary" href={SITE.playtestFormUrl} rel="noopener">Request to join the playtest</a>
			</p>
			<h2>What we ask for</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>An email for the download. A Google account (Gmail) works best, because the build is shared through Google Drive.</li>
				<li>Your Steam name. Online play goes through Steam friends.</li>
				<li>Your country and time zone, a rough idea of your PC, and how you'd like to play.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>What happens next</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Requests are reviewed by hand, so it can take a few days.</li>
				<li>If you're approved, Google emails you a link to the playtest folder.</li>
				<li>You agree not to share the download or the game files, to ask before posting videos or screenshots, and to send feedback through the feedback form in the playtest folder.</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="muted">
				We only use what you send to run the playtest. It isn't shared with anyone else.
			</p>
			<div class="plate-wrap community">
				<section class="plate" aria-labelledby="community-h">
					<h2 id="community-h">Hang out on Discord</h2>
					<p>
						The Firnreach Discord is where playtesters and anyone curious hang out: news and updates are posted
						there, and it's the easiest place to ask questions, share ideas and talk to the developer. You don't need
						to be in the playtest to join.
					</p>
					<a class="btn discord" href={SITE.discordUrl} rel="noopener">
						<DiscordIcon />
						Join the Discord
					</a>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Site>

<style>
	.playtest {
		margin-bottom: 72px;
	}
	.playtest .btn {
		margin-block: 8px 16px;
	}
	.community {
		margin-top: 40px;
	}
	.community .plate {
		padding: 24px 20px 8px;
	}
	.community h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3.5vw, 1.6rem);
	}
	.community p {
		color: var(--fr-text-2);
	}
</style>
